WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
A region marked in the source

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.900
In the menu (C-c c ?), w asks how to rewrite it

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.700
Waiting for the rewrite

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:18.800
The new code appears above the original

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.600
Press RET on it to accept it, and the buffer is rewritten
